<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns TRUE if the follower is in the active party FALSE otherwise. This should be used only for non-plot followers. For plot followers (Alistair, Sten etc.) use the plot flags in the global party plot.
</p><p><br />
